<main id="main">
<section class="sub-hero"><div class="sub-hero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/contractor.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/contractor-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/contractor.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="639" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="shell sub-hero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/">Calculators</a><span class="sep">›</span><span aria-current="page">Appraisal Readiness Checkup</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free checklist · runs in your browser</p><h1>Appraisal Readiness Checkup</h1><p class="lede">Appraisals are often won or lost on the file you bring. Answer twelve quick questions to see where yours stands and what to finish before demanding appraisal.</p></div></section><section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="shell"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="ready">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Appraisal readiness checkup</span><i>12 questions · about two minutes</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <ol class="quiz"><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get written confirmation that coverage is accepted. If the claim was denied, talk to a Utah attorney before considering appraisal."><span>Has the insurer accepted coverage for at least part of the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Request the full line-item estimate (not just the summary) in writing."><span>Do you have the carrier’s complete, itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get an independent, line-item estimate — a lump-sum bid won’t hold up before a panel."><span>Do you have your own itemized estimate from a contractor or estimator?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Gather every photo you have and note when each was taken. Add new photos of current conditions."><span>Do you have dated photos of the damage taken soon after the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the ‘Appraisal’ paragraph in the conditions section and note any deadlines."><span>Have you read your policy’s appraisal clause?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Locate the ‘Suit Against Us’ clause and calendar the date — our deadline planner can help."><span>Do you know your policy’s suit-limitation date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Complete reasonable temporary repairs and keep every receipt."><span>Have temporary repairs been made and receipts saved?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Download or request your current declarations page."><span>Do you have your declarations page?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make sure wet walls, attics and decking have been inspected so the scope is complete."><span>Is all hidden damage opened up and documented?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Collect emails, letters and claim notes in date order."><span>Is your correspondence with the carrier organized by date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Run the numbers in our appraisal value estimator — a small gap may not justify appraisal costs."><span>Is the gap between estimates more than about 10% or $5,000?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="If a proof of loss was requested, submit it on time."><span>Has a sworn proof of loss been submitted if the carrier asked for one?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn ghost small" data-reset>Reset answers</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,300px) 1fr;align-items:start">
      <div>
        <svg class="gauge" viewBox="0 0 200 110" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#e9eef8" stroke-width="18"/><path data-o="arc" d="M20 100 A80 80 0 0 1 180 100" fill="none" stroke="#e0703a" stroke-width="18" stroke-dasharray="251.3" stroke-dashoffset="251.3" style="transition:stroke-dashoffset .5s,stroke .3s"/></svg>
        <div class="gauge-num"><span data-o="score">–</span></div>
        <p class="hint" style="text-align:center">Answered <span data-o="count">0 / 12</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="out-msg" data-o="verdict"></p>
        <p class="todo-h">Your to-do list</p>
        <ul data-o="todo" style="margin:0;padding-left:1.1em"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div><p class="tool-note">For planning only. Results depend on what you enter and on your policy, and aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice. Nothing you enter is stored.</p></div></section><div class="shell two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>How the checkup is weighted</h2>
<p>Coverage, itemized estimates and evidence carry the most weight. They decide whether appraisal is the right tool and how well your number will hold up. Organizational items matter but are easier to fix.</p>
<h2>Using your score</h2>
<ul><li><strong>75 or higher:</strong> a well-built file. A professional review of the gap is a logical next step.</li>
<li><strong>45 to 74:</strong> close the open items before you demand appraisal.</li>
<li><strong>Under 45:</strong> demanding appraisal now could lock in a low number. Build the file first.</li></ul>
<h2>Questions about this calculator</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is anything I enter saved?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>No. The checkup runs entirely in your browser and nothing is stored or sent.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I share the result?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Take a screenshot of your score and to-do list and bring it to your consultation.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free calculators</h2><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel" href="/utah-claim-calculators/roof-snow-load-estimator/"><small>Estimator</small><span>Roof Snow Load Estimator</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/utah-claim-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><small>Estimator</small><span>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/utah-claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>RCV to ACV Holdback Calculator</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="aside"><div class="aside-in"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-t">Talk it through, free</h2><p>Send the carrier’s estimate or call. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal is worth it.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-accent btn-block" href="/contact-utah-appraiser/